# design-lint baseline. Counts only go down: `make lint` lowers them.
# Raising one needs `make lint-rebaseline`, DESIGN_LINT_ALLOW_RAISE=1 on push, and a PR note.
version 1
format off
font-size 48
padding-literal 13
spacing-literal 14
radius-literal 24
hex-color 3
raw-color 7
raw-control off AppKit implements the kit controls
file-length 4
try-bang 0
force-cast 0
force-unwrap 1
print 0
opacity-literal 264
frame-literal 50
chamfer-literal 106
motion-literal 6
